  "description": "Who says you can't have it all (in a road bike)? The Rivette is our race-ready all-arounder, meticulously crafted from a mix of high-pitch carbon fiber in custom size-specific layups for an unmatched blend of unwavering stiffness and feathery weight. The Rivette's stiff headtube delivers precise steering for razor-sharp cornering and control. Aero tube shapes and fully internal cable routing create clean lines and reduce drag, ensuring every watt translates to pure speed. And with a short rear end for explosive acceleration, the Rivette's geometry is fine-tuned to let you conquer climbs, attack descents and carve through corners at race pace. Feel the road disappear beneath you as you push your limits and chase the podium on the Rivette.\n\nThe most affordable of the Rivette carbon family, the Carbon 2 ticks all the boxes for a performance road bike. With a 105 Di2 electronic groupset and internal cable routing for a clean cockpit, it has everything you need to roll up to the start line.",
